3. Datasets Supported & Fetched by `kroch-chhmar`
   Please note that while the `kroch-chhmar` codebase is licensed under the MIT License,
   compiled dictionaries generated using third-party corpora or lexicons are subject to
   the respective licenses of those upstream datasets:

   - khPOS (Khmer Part-of-Speech Corpus)
     * URL: https://github.com/ye-kyaw-thu/khPOS
     * Author: Ye Kyaw Thu et al.
     * License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)

   - Asian Language Treebank (ALT) Khmer NOVA Corpus
     * URL: https://www2.nict.go.jp/astrec-att/member/mutiyama/ALT/km-nova-181101.zip
     * Project Page: https://www2.nict.go.jp/astrec-att/member/mutiyama/ALT/index.html
     * Authors: NICT & NIPTICT (Masao Utiyama et al.)
     * License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)

   - Khmer LineBreaking Dictionary (`khmerlbdict`)
     * URL: https://github.com/silnrsi/khmerlbdict
     * Author: SIL International (Non-Roman Script Initiative)
     * License: MIT License

   - Royal Academy of Cambodia (RAC) Khmer Dictionary 2022 (`khmer-dictionary-44k`)
     * URL: https://huggingface.co/datasets/seanghay/khmer-dictionary-44k
     * Source: Royal Academy of Cambodia (extracted by Seanghay Yath)
     * License / Terms: Research and non-commercial use only

4. Bundled Compiled Dictionary Notice
   The pre-compiled `system_khmer.dic` shipped in the wheel is built only from
   MIT-licensed sources: the project's own seed lexicon/corpus (MIT) and SIL
   International's `khmerlbdict` wordlists (MIT). It is redistributable under
   the MIT terms above.

   The optional full research build (`kroch-chhmar prepare --profile full`)
   additionally ingests khPOS (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), NICT ALT NOVA (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0),
   and the RAC 2022 dictionary (research/non-commercial terms). That build is
   not included in the wheel and must not be redistributed or used commercially
   without permission from the upstream rights holders.
